Issued at 1822 UTC Thursday, August  7, 2025



.AVIATION...

(18Z TAFS)

Issued at 1222 PM CDT Thu Aug 7 2025

VFR conditions are expected over the next 24 hours. Breezy to

gusty southwest winds are expected during this time frame at all

of the sites with gusts upwards of 25 kts. There is a low chance

(10 percent or less) for a shower or storm near KDHT early in this

TAF cycle. Confidence is way too low for potential impacts at the

terminal to include in the TAF. Mostly clear skies are expected

with some high clouds across the region.

