.DISCUSSION...Scattered showers and a few thunderstorms continue

early this evening, diminishing somewhat overnight. If you get hit

by a thunderstorm core then wetting rains should be easy to

achieve, otherwise wetting rain chances are low. 



Other than a few showers on Friday, it will be drying out.

Westerly winds will be notable on Friday afternoon with gusts to

around 20 mph. 



