Pueblo Aviation Discussion

Issued at 2315 UTC Thursday, August  7, 2025



.AVIATION /00Z TAFS THROUGH 00Z FRIDAY/...

Issued at 513 PM MDT Thu Aug 7 2025

VFR conditions are expected at KALS, KCOS, and KPUB through 24 

hours. Gusty winds 20-25 knots or so will persist at the terminals 

through at least 02Z, and a bit longer at KALS. Winds weaken 

overnight with lingering mid-level clouds, before west winds gusting 

25-35 knots set in across the area Friday afternoon, with the 

stronger gusts over KALS. There is a very low chance of some showers 

and virga at the terminals Friday afternoon as well, but current 

chances are too low and isolated to include in this round of TAFs.





