.AVIATION...Friday 08/00Z through Saturday 09/00Z...VFR conditions. 

Localized FU/HZ downwind from wildfire activity, especially along

a line north of KGCN to KPGA. Isolated -SHRA/-TSRA through 03Z

this evening and again after 18Z Fri, primarily in Navajo and 

Apache counties. Winds SW-W 10-20 kts gusting to 25-30 kts 

through 03Z this evening, light and variable overnight, then SW-W 

10-20 kts with gusts 20-35 kts - strongest north of I-40 and west

of Hwy 89.

OUTLOOK...Saturday 09/00Z through Monday 11/00Z...VFR conditions. 

Localized FU/HZ downwind from wildfire activity, especially along

a line north of KGCN to KPGA. Isolated to scattered -SHRA/-TSRA

each day, primarily from KFLG eastward. Daytime winds SW-W 10-15 

kts gusting to 25 kts. Winds light and variable during the 

overnight periods.





