Marine Weather Statement

National Weather Service Gaylord MI

817 PM EDT Thu Aug 7 2025



LHZ348-080045-

817 PM EDT Thu Aug 7 2025



A Marine Weather Statement has been issued for the following areas...

  Presque Isle Light to Sturgeon Pt MI Including Thunder Bay 

  National Marine Sanctuary...



At 817 PM EDT, Doppler radar indicated a strong thunderstorm, capable

of producing winds to around 30 knots and small hail. This

thunderstorm was located over Alpena, moving east at 15 knots.



Locations impacted include...

Thunder Bay and Alpena.



PRECAUTIONARY/PREPAREDNESS ACTIONS...



Mariners can expect gusty winds to around 30 knots, locally higher

waves, and lightning strikes. Boaters should seek safe harbor

immediately until this storm passes.



