.AVIATION /00Z TAFS THROUGH 00Z SATURDAY/... 

Issued at 450 PM MDT Thu Aug 7 2025

Main forecast challenge this evening will revolve around

the progression of a thunderstorm through northwest Kansas as 

there is a chance this thunderstorm tracks in the vicinity of 

MCK this evening. Primary threats include strong wind gusts and

a potential reduction in VIS and CIG, should the storm build 

and track closer to the terminal. Otherwise, TAFs this update 

indicate continued VFR conditions and generally light winds; 

though an increase in northwest winds can be expected tomorrow 



