843

WTPQ32 PGUM 080053

TCPPQ2



BULLETIN

Tropical Storm 16W Intermediate Advisory Number 4A

National Weather Service Tiyan GU WP162025

1053 AM ChST Fri Aug 8 2025



...TROPICAL STORM PODUL (16W) MOVING NORTHWEST...



CHANGES WITH THIS ADVISORY

--------------------------

None. 



WATCHES AND WARNINGS

--------------------

A Tropical Storm Watch continues for Agrihan, Pagan, and Alamagan. 



A Tropical Storm Watch means that tropical storm conditions, 

including winds of 39 to 73 mph, are possible, but not expected.



SUMMARY OF 100 PM CHST...0300 UTC...INFORMATION

-----------------------------------------------

Location...20.1N 145.7E



About 95 miles north of Agrihan

About 135 miles north of Pagan

About 170 miles north of Alamagan

About 345 miles north of Saipan

About 355 miles north of Tinian

About 410 miles north of Rota

About 425 miles southeast of Iwo To

About 460 miles north of Guam



Maximum sustained winds...40 mph

Present movement...northwest...305 degrees at 10 mph



DISCUSSION AND OUTLOOK

----------------------

At 100 PM CHST...0300 UTC...the center of Tropical Storm 16W was 

located near Latitude 20.1 degrees North and Longitude 145.7 degrees 

East. 16W is moving northwest at 10 mph. It is expected to make a 

slight turn toward the west-northwest with little change in forward 

speed through Saturday.



Maximum sustained winds remain at 40 mph. 16W is forecast to

intensify through tonight.



Tropical storm force winds extend outward from the center up to 60 

miles to the southeast with no tropical storm force winds elsewhere.



NEXT ADVISORY

------------- 

The next scheduled advisory will be issued by the National Weather 

Service at 200 PM ChST followed by an intermediate advisory at 500 

PM ChST.



$$



Kleeschulte



