707 PM MDT Thu Aug 7 2025



Forecast is based on forecast start time of 0700 MDT on August 08. 

If conditions become unrepresentative, contact the National Weather

Service.



Please contact our office at (208) 232-9357, if you have questions

or concerns with this forecast.



...RED FLAG WARNING IN EFFECT UNTIL 9 PM MDT THIS EVENING...



.DISCUSSION...

High pressure starts building in behind an exiting cold front 

early on Friday. Temperatures will be much cooler than normal 

Friday and Saturday with high temperatures in the mid to high 70s.

Winds will be breezy Friday afternoon with gusts of 20 to 25 mph.

Expect lighter winds on Saturday and continued dry conditions 

under high pressure. 



